title: distress_trap_start
tags: trap
---
A distress beacon pulsates from a debris field. It claims to be a civilian transport out of fuel. #line:distress_trap_start_00 #illustration:illustration_beacon
-> Approach to assist #line:distress_trap_start_01
    <<if roll(100) <= 70>>
    <<jump distress_trap_trap_spring>>
    <<else>>
    <<jump distress_trap_real_survivors>>
    <<endif>>
-> Ignore #line:distress_trap_start_02 #leave
    <<stop>>
===

title: distress_trap_trap_spring
tags: 
---
As you power down weapons to transfer fuel, pirate signatures flare to life all around you! It's a trap! #line:distress_trap_trap_spring_00
-> Battle Stations! #line:distress_trap_trap_spring_01
    <<start_combat encounter_raiders>>
===

title: distress_trap_real_survivors
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_success>>
You find a small pod with a grateful survivor. They offer a Blueprint in exchange for the fuel. #line:distress_trap_real_survivors_00
-> Trade Fuel for Blueprint <<if has_item("resource_fuel", 2)>> #line:distress_trap_real_survivors_01
    <<take_item resource_fuel 2>>
    <<give_item item_research_blueprint 1>>
    <<stop>>
-> Leave them #line:distress_trap_real_survivors_02 #leave
    <<stop>>
===

